> - Continue to engage with MoFs and economic decision-makers to promote the adoption of the insights and frameworks developed during this project.
> - Pursue further research to fill identified gaps, particularly in adaptation finance and the economic returns of specific investments.
> - Support ongoing integration efforts in collaboration with partners and stakeholders involved in the Baku to Belem climate finance roadmap.
> 
> **Conclusion:**
> 
> The successful completion of this project marks a significant step forward in understanding the macroeconomic and fiscal impacts of climate inaction and the imperative to invest in adaptation. We are optimistic that these insights will facilitate more informed decision-making and foster resilient economic development globally.
